# Security Basics

Full detail: `docs/context/SECURITY.md`.

- No hardcoded secrets; keep `.env` out of git.
- Flutter: Supabase **anon** key only — never **service_role** in the client.
- Enable **RLS** on all tables; users only access their own data.
- ESP32: constrained INSERT path — not service_role.
- Validate sensor ranges; out-of-range fails visibly.
- HTTPS; secure storage for auth tokens when Auth is on.
